s put focus on security - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/news/impacts-of-middle-east-conflict-set-to-reshape-energy-investment-plans-as-disruptions-put-focus-on-security?utm_content=buffer8e130&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffer", "url": "https://t.co/NQitQP89IS"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/4UYaaXK8Qy", "end": 312, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2116526922213511667/video/1", "media_key": "7_2116526877569359872", "start": 289, "url": "https://t.co/4UYaaXK8Qy"}]}, "id": "2116526922213511667", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2471, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "The Middle East conflict is set to reshape energy investment plans, with disruptions putting the focus on energy security\n\nElectricity &amp; diversification are driving spending - with countries turning to domestic energy sources &amp; developing new trade routes: https://t.co/NQitQP89IS https://t.co/4UYaaXK8Qy", "url": "https://x.com/IEA/status/2116526922213511667"}, {"author_id": "84679163", "created_at": "2026-10-31T12:45:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116511780759294196"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Electric Car Markets in a Time of Uncertainty - Analysis and key findings. A report by the International Energy Agency.", "display_url": "buff.ly/SVN2Eiu", "end": 284, "expanded_url": "https://buff.ly/SVN2Eiu", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116511830654763008/ogxhOfEX?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116511830654763008/ogxhOfEX?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 261, "status": 200, "title": "Executive summary - Electric Car Markets in a Time of Uncertainty - IEA", "unwound_url": "https://www.iea.org/reports/electric-car-markets-in-a-time-of-uncertainty/executive-summary?utm_content=buffere146f&utm_medium=social&utm_source=twitter.com&utm_campaign=buffe